OL,3,GNEWSATrain attack passenger feared
OL,4,A'suicide bomber'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger on a train where a mass
OL,7,Fstabbing took place said he initially
OL,8,Fthought it might have been a suicide
OL,9,Fbomber, a court has heard.
OL,11,FMilan Campion was travelling on a
OL,12,FLondon-bound LNER service on 1 November
OL,13,Flast year when it made an unscheduled
OL,14,Fstop at Huntingdon amid an attack by
OL,15,FAnthony Williams, Cambridge Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FCampion told jurors Williams was
OL,19,F"threatening everyone indiscriminately"
OL,20,Fso he "came to the conclusion that he
OL,21,Fwasn't sound of mind".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
