OL,3,GNEWSATrain attack passenger feared
OL,4,A'suicide bomber'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, 33, of Peterborough, denies
OL,7,F10 counts of attempted murder on the
OL,8,Ftrain. He is also charged with four
OL,9,Fother attempted murders following
OL,10,Fearlier incidents in Peterborough and
OL,11,FLondon.
